<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Hi&nbsp;</font><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!Lead.Lead_Owner_Name__c}</b></font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">, A new lead has been assigned to you.</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Here are the details:</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Lead Name:</b> {!Lead.Name}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Organization Type:</b> {!Lead.Organization_Type__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Area of Interest:</b> {!Lead.Area_of_Interest__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Estimated Contribution Range:</b> {!Lead.Estimated_Contribution_Range__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please review and follow up promptly.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
